### 登入
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user4@example.com",
  "password": "12341234"
}

### 刷新 Access Token（用 login 回傳的 refresh_token）
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "98fa4447ea04137cb1c60556ed486ab0b69e25fdceb7823e962e8e4f8e94ae01"
}

### 登出（雙 token 失效：需同時帶 access_token + refresh_token）
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste_access_token_here

{
  "refresh_token": "paste_refresh_token_here"
}

### 註冊
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user4",
  "email": "user4@example.com",
  "password": "12341234"
}

### 取得個人資料
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/profile

### 商品列表（公開，支援分頁與搜尋）
GET http://localhost:3000/products?page=1&limit=20&search=rope

### 商品詳情（公開）
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### 建立商品（需 ADMIN，用 login 回傳的 access_token）
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste_access_token_here

{
  "name": "product1",
  "description": "product1 description",
  "price": 100,
  "stock": 100
}

### 更新商品（需 ADMIN）
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste_access_token_here

{
  "price": 120,
  "stock": 80
}

### 刪除商品（需 ADMIN）
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/1
Authorization: Bearer paste_access_token_here
